# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECRETS — never commit
#
# This project deliberately has NO API keys (see docs/architecture.md):
# flutter_map needs none, and there is no backend. These rules exist so
# that stays true even if someone later adds an integration.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
